b.org/t/p/w780/rA2nDNE8theQJ0RBihZqBLDgsms.jpg","released":"2025-06-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"La ley primordial","overview":"Mitts y Pryce evalúan a Santi durante 18 hoyos. Al probar nuevos palos, Pryce intenta impartir su sabiduría sobre disfrutar el presente.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ckT9fJ46zKR5cSvEkBVOyl437Zi.jpg","released":"2025-06-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Problemas paternales","overview":"El grupo viaja en la casa rodante de Mitts. Los métodos de Pryce son puestos a prueba en el primer torneo. Santi hace una amiga que mejora su juego.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w71OU0cSKdB6PygSsslUcVBOPTj.jpg","released":"2025-06-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"33 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Zero se une al juego","overview":"Pryce hace todo lo que puede para hablar con Santi y volver al entrenamiento. Zero recibe una oferta inesperada.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zOmjR7zgLpRx0u4ybWT9G8vwP2O.jpg","released":"2025-06-10T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"32 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"La máquina de birdies","overview":"Santi empieza en la clasificatoria con una nueva caddie, mientras Pryce emplea tácticas de entrenamiento encubiertas. Mitts dice verdades dolorosas y recibe su merecido.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ajusjRpRrW2vUrAqisyZB0Js1cJ.jpg","released":"2025-06-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"31 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Mi Shangri-La","overview":"Antes del campeonato U.S. Amateur, Pryce les da el día libre a todos. Mitts se arriesga. Santi descubre algo doloroso.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xGIuAuA9yHQ7Lf2li5TtFEAdOO1.jpg","released":"2025-06-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"34 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Sueños olvidados","overview":"Después de arruinar las cosas con Santi, Pryce reflexiona sobre su pasado y lo que pudo haber sido. El grupo se prepara para separarse.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/66WjHuiZEorjRf1QgX6TkKimjc1.jpg","released":"2025-07-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Clark el mejor","overview":"Se desarrolla un plan para engañar a Clark Ross. Pryce tiene la oportunidad de demostrar que siempre fue mejor golfista.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oDzksnme2WhLgXgDkMq4pPepnbl.jpg","released":"2025-07-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Hora del show","overview":"Pryce intenta ayudar a Santi con la presión de su primer torneo PGA. El romance surge mientras Santi sube en el marcador.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nel6IQFH3pp5oZYsCIJOhr2Wwts.jpg","released":"2025-07-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"29 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Déjà Vu de nuevo","overview":"En el último día del torneo, un visitante inesperado altera las cosas mientras los sueños de Santi están en juego.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dnozIh3LzGli2EaklqeWW7dGZfy.jpg","released":"2025-07-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"35 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:2:1","season":2,"episode":1,"title":"La sirena de ser profesional","overview":"Mientras el mundo del golf espera a que Santi se vuelva profesional, Pryce recuerda sus días de gloria.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tkVcVIjxCRdsa1RD2zO0hw9028H.jpg","released":"2026-11-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"30 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:2:2","season":2,"episode":2,"title":"No seas la mayonesa en el verano","overview":"El grupo va a Los Ángeles, donde Santi acapara la atención en el PGA Tour. Clark le presenta una idea loca a Pryce.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wXOBrYlEkf7uwj7hbCpPIEZnoIo.jpg","released":"2026-11-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"36 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:2:3","season":2,"episode":3,"title":"De tal palo, tal astilla","overview":"Santi hace su esperado debut profesional, mientras Pryce hace un viaje para ver a su exmaestro.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6UapMZvnthYxKshfCXkc5ciRGkH.jpg","released":"2026-11-10T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"38 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:2:4","season":2,"episode":4,"title":"The Boog","overview":"Pryce tries everything to recruit a swing coach. Santi gets pulled deeper into the PGA machine.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/djvLJEwLVZ3aG4p2wZZXik52Ajw.jpg","released":"2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"26 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:2:5","season":2,"episode":5,"title":"Go Time!","released":"2026-11-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"37 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:2:6","season":2,"episode":6,"title":"Jung and the Restless","released":"2026-12-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"41 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:2:7","season":2,"episode":7,"title":"Bogey Nights","released":"2026-12-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"35 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:2:8","season":2,"episode":8,"title":"Fast Greens Do Not Hold","released":"2026-12-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"34 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:2:9","season":2,"episode":9,"title":"Let 'er Rip","released":"2026-12-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"34 min"},{"id":"tt31710249:2:10","season":2,"episode":10,"title":"Episodio 10","released":"2026-12-29T12:00:00.000Z"}]}}